      "review_description": "Great overall experience dealing with AK from SEN Australia to have a 5.28kW, 12-panel Solar system installed at my Melbourne home. The price for my system was also very reasonable - $4,800 in total, including replacement of my ageing switchboard.The entire process - from his visit to my house, to receiving the initial quote - right through to the installation has been straightforward and I've been kept well-informed at every step along the way.The installation itself was handled professionally and occurred on time as scheduled, by an experienced team who directly work for him. SEN Australia is currently organising my system to be connected to the grid (installation was done just 4 days ago) and I have every confidence in their processes and outstanding customer service to date!",
