      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Cold called this local company due to dissatisfaction with other quotes received - too many companies are price focused, not quality focused. Spent an hour on the phone with AK from SEN Australia before I even committed to anything - he walked me through all the options and provided well justified recommendations to make sure I was properly informed. I can tell that he is genuinely passionate about solar, and top-tier installations.Answered any and all of my curly questions leading up to the install, including going above and beyond to source some less common monitoring gear.Install was completed within a month of first contact, to an amazing standard. He even deliberately works with a strict inspector to ensure that his work is up to scratch and done properly.If you're located in northern Melbourne and are after a local who really knows his stuff and isn't just in it for a quick buck, AK from SEN Australia is your guy.",
